<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="es-DO">
<head>
  <meta charset="utf-8" />
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
  <title>Proyecta — Verificación</title>
  <style>
    body { margin: 0; padding: 0; background-color: #f2f3f0; }
    .wrap { width: 100%; background-color: #f2f3f0; padding: 32px 0; }
    .card { max-width: 480px; margin: 0 auto; background: #ffffff; border: 1px solid #cbccc9; border-radius: 16px;
      padding: 32px; font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; color: #111111; line-height: 1.6; }
    .brand { font-family: "Courier New", monospace; font-weight: 700; font-size: 18px; letter-spacing: 1px; color: #111111; }
    .dot { display: inline-block; width: 12px; height: 12px; border-radius: 3px; background: #ec5e2b; margin-right: 8px; vertical-align: middle; }
    .code { display: inline-block; padding: 8px 14px; font-family: "Courier New", monospace; font-size: 20px; font-weight: 700;
      letter-spacing: 3px; color: #ec5e2b; background: #18181b; border-radius: 10px; }
    .button { display: inline-block; padding: 12px 24px; background: #ec5e2b; color: #ffffff !important; text-decoration: none;
      border-radius: 999px; font-weight: bold; }
    .muted { color: #666666; font-size: 13px; }
    .hr { height: 1px; background: #e7e8e5; border: 0; margin: 24px 0; }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="card">
      <div class="brand"><span class="dot"></span>PROYECTA</div>
      <hr class="hr" />
      <p style="margin:0 0 12px;">Tu código de verificación es:</p>
      <p style="margin:0 0 12px;"><span class="code">{{verificationCode}}</span></p>
      <hr class="hr" />
      <p class="muted" style="margin:0;">Proyecta · Pantallas digitales en toda la República Dominicana.</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</body>
</html>
